many of which are outside of our control and as a result, may not fully reflect the underlying performance of our business. For example,
we tend to experience higher revenue from our Hotels and Packages Business (including MICE) in the second and fourth calendar quarters
of each year, which coincide with the summer holiday travel season and the year-end holiday travel season for our customers in India
and other markets. In our Air Ticketing Business, we may have higher revenues in a particular quarter arising out of periodic discounted
sales of tickets by our suppliers. Other factors that may cause fluctuations in our quarterly financial results include, but are not
limited to:</span></p>

