<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">We
define a &#8220;visit&#8221; as a group of interactions on our platform that occur within a 30-minute time frame. A single visit can
contain multiple screen or page views, events, and transactions. We use &#8220;traffic&#8221; and &#8220;visits&#8221; interchangeably
in this Annual Report.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">We continue to operate a scaled digital travel platform that enables customers
to search and book travel services across web and mobile channels. We are leveraging artificial intelligence capabilities across customer
touchpoints to enhance personalization, operational efficiency and service quality. During FY 2026, our web and mobile properties received
approximately 88 million visits. As of March 31, 2026, our mobile applications had been downloaded approximately 22.4 million times.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


