<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Based
on our large and loyal customer base, our comprehensive service offerings, our experienced management team and our multi-channel strategy,
we believe that we are well-positioned to capitalize on the burgeoning Indian travel market. Our brand is among the most well-recognized
in not only the Indian online travel industry, but all of Indian Internet commerce, and we believe that this creates a significant competitive
advantage. Leveraging our brand and technology platform, we intend to continue to expand and enhance our offerings through innovative
travel solutions that will grow our business, improve our customer experience, and meet the changing needs of business and leisure travelers.
For example, we have opened our holidays booking platform to third-party vendors enabling them to sell holiday products alongside those
packaged by us using our platform as a marketplace, providing our customers with a wide selection of products and services.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">To
further strengthen customer loyalty and provide an incentive to the employees of our corporate customers to transact with us as B2C customers,
we operate a proprietary eCash loyalty program that enables travelers that book through our platform to accumulate and redeem points,
where applicable. Our eCash loyalty program acts as a surrogate and fills the loyalty gap that exists across product categories such
as air travel and hotels in the travel market in India. We currently have over approximately thirteen million eCash registered users on
our platform. During fiscal year 2026, approximately 80% of our customers&#8217; visits have been from direct and organic traffic. We
have moved towards a &#8220;Mobile First&#8221; business and have experienced rapid user growth on our platform with mobile being the
primary channel for customers to engage with us.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">We
believe our brand is among the most well-recognized Internet brands in the Indian travel industry. Leveraging our brand and technology
platform, we intend to continue to expand and enhance our offerings through innovative travel solutions that will grow our business,
improve our customer experience, and meet the changing needs of business and leisure travelers. For example, we have opened our holidays
booking platform to third-party vendors enabling them to sell holiday products alongside those packaged by us using our platform as a
marketplace, providing our customers with a wide selection of products and services.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">We
experience seasonal fluctuations in the demand for travel services and products offered by us. We tend to experience higher revenues
from our hotels and packages business, or &#8220;Hotels and Packages Business (including MICE),&#8221; in the second and fourth
calendar quarters of each calendar year, which coincide with the summer holiday travel season and the year-end holiday travel season
for our customers in India.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Our
revenue from rendering of services was INR 3,583.8 million, INR 7,383.5 million and INR 9,539.2 million in fiscal years 2024, 2025 and
2026, respectively. Adjusted Margin totaled INR 5,821.6 million in fiscal 2024, INR 5,373.9 million in fiscal 2025 and INR 6,462.9 million
in fiscal 2026. Gross Bookings across for Air Ticketing, Hotels and Packages (including MICE) and other services businesses was INR 75,948.0
million, INR 70,910.2 million and INR 80,535.8 million in fiscal years 2024, 2025 and 2026 respectively. We reported net loss INR 366.5
million and net profit INR 23.5 million in fiscal years 2024 and 2025 respectively. In fiscal year 2026 we incurred a net loss of INR
66.0 million.</span></p>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
13.6% year-over-year increased in Gross Bookings during fiscal 2026 was primarily attributable to softness in the air ticketing segment.
Adjusted Margin also increased by 14% over the same fiscal year.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">In
our Air Ticketing Business Gross Bookings were INR 64,950.1 million, INR 55,272.8 million and INR 61,874.8 million for fiscal years
2024, 2025 and 2026 respectively. Corresponding Adjusted Margins were INR 4,502.4 million, INR 3,588.2 million and INR 4,372.7
million. In contrast, Gross Bookings from Hotels and Packages (including MICE) Business increased from INR 8,758.9 million for
fiscal year 2024 to INR 13,053.4 million in fiscal year 2025 and further to INR 16,577.6 million in fiscal year 2026, while Adjusted Margin for this segment were INR 1,140.1 million, INR
1,472.7 million and INR 1,761.9 million respectively reflecting strong growth in the higher-margin leisure travel
category.</span></p>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
increase in revenue from services in fiscal 2026&#8212;up 129.2% from INR 7383.5 million in fiscal year 2025 to INR 9,539.2 million was
driven by the rebound in travel demand and the continued scaling of our platform. However, the increase in Adjusted Margin during the
same fiscal year was a result of competitive pricing pressures in air ticketing and increased promotional spending in the hotels and packages
segment.</span></p>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Adjusted
Margin is a non-IFRS measure. For more information about the non-IFRS measures and a reconciliation to the most comparable IFRS measure,
please refer to &#8220;<i>Item 5. Operating and Financial Review and Prospects-Key Operating Metrics.</i>&#8221;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">We have continued to invest significantly in our technology infrastructure
and customer acquisition initiatives to support future growth. Our continued investments in our mobile platform have strengthened customer
engagement, with approximately 71% of our mobile traffic originating from our mobile applications during fiscal year 2026, reflecting
strong customer preference for our app-based experience.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">As of March 31, 2026, our mobile
applications had been installed approximately 22.4 million times, with a significant portion of these installations on Android devices.
We also received an average of approximately 9 million monthly visits from online shoppers on our platform, underscoring our growing consumer
engagement.</p>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Unless
otherwise specifically stated, the market and industry information and statistics included in the below description of our business is
as of March 31, 2026.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


