<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><b>Recent Product Development &#8211; AI-Powered Travel
Platform</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify">During Fiscal Year 2026, Yatra significantly expanded
its artificial intelligence capabilities across both its consumer and enterprise businesses, leveraging generative AI, large language
models and nearly two decades of proprietary travel intelligence to deliver more intuitive customer experiences and automate enterprise
travel workflows.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify">A key milestone during the year was the
expansion of DIYA (Digital Intelligent Yatra Advisor), Yatra&#8217;s proprietary AI-powered travel agent. Among the early travel platforms
to offer end-to-end itinerary planning and booking through a conversational interface, DIYA enables travelers to plan and book trips
using natural language, while providing personalized recommendations based on travel preferences. For enterprise customers, DIYA further
integrates corporate travel policies, negotiated supplier rates and employee entitlements to deliver policy-aware booking recommendations
and simplify compliance.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company also deployed AI across its enterprise
servicing operations through intelligent workflow automation. Yatra&#8217;s AI-powered automation engine interprets customer requests
received through email and automates routine servicing activities, including booking requests, itinerary modifications, cancellations
and ticket retrieval, improving response times, service consistency and operational efficiency.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify">These developments represent an important step in
Yatra&#8217;s strategy of building an AI-native travel platform that combines proprietary enterprise data, intelligent automation and advanced
AI models to deliver increasingly personalized travel experiences and scalable operating efficiencies.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><b>RECAP (Receipt Capture and Processing)</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">In
fiscal year 2025, Yatra launched a significant product innovation with the release of its <b>Expense Management Solution</b>, further
strengthening its position as India&#8217;s largest corporate travel services provider. This launch aligns with our strategy to deliver
comprehensive, end-to-end travel and expense solutions tailored for both domestic and international enterprises.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
new platform is designed to streamline and automate the entire expense lifecycle&#8212;covering both travel and non-travel expenditures&#8212;within
a single, unified interface. It supports core corporate travel functions such as booking flights, hotels, and ground transportation,
while also managing the expense submission, approval, and reimbursement process with high accuracy and efficiency.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

