<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Our holiday packages offerings consist of both fixed departure and customized
holiday packages. Given our focus on the Indian middle-class consumers, many of whom are not seasoned travelers, our customers typically
prefer booking holiday packages where most elements of their travel, including flights, hotels, sightseeing, transport, visa and insurance,
are all taken care of. In addition, we provide end-to-end Meetings, Incentives, Conferences and Exhibitions (&#8220;MICE&#8221;) solutions
to our corporate customers. Our MICE offerings cover event planning, group travel, accommodation,
transportation, visa assistance, attendee engagement and on-ground execution across domestic and international destinations. We have approximately
850 holiday packages to destinations within India, Asia, Middle East, and Europe. We also opened our platform to third-party holiday packages
sellers who can now sell alongside our own products through our platform, thereby offering our customers a wider choice of products. We
also operate 7 franchisees within India offering regional presence along with our call center catering to demand across India.</span></p>

