<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
August 12, 2024, the Board of Directors of Yatra India had approved a Composite Scheme of Amalgamation (&#8220;Scheme&#8221;) involving
Yatra India and its six wholly-owned subsidiaries. The Mumbai Bench of the NCLT, through its final order dated October 14, 2025 (&#8220;Order&#8221;),
had approved and sanctioned the Scheme with the appointed date of the amalgamation being April 01, 2024 and Scheme became effective on
December 01, 2025 i.e. date of filing of the certified true copy of the Order with the Registrar of Companies, Mumbai.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p>
