    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
    February 17, 2026, THCL, our wholly owned subsidiary of Yatra Online, Inc. (the
    &#8220;Company&#8221;), sold 2,833,000 Equity Shares of Yatra India, representing approximately 1.8% of Yatra India&#8217;s outstanding
    share capital, in open market transactions (the &#8220;Share Sale&#8221;). The proceeds from the Share Sale are intended to fund
