capital of INR 522.6 million in the fiscal year ended March 31, 2025. The net decrease in working capital in the fiscal year ended March
31, 2026, was primarily due to INR 496.7 million decrease in trade and other receivables, which was partially offset by INR 360.8 million
decrease in trade and other payables. The net increase in working capital in the fiscal year ended March 31, 2025, was primarily due to
INR 693.2 million increase in trade and other receivables and INR 121.9 million increase in trade and other payables.</span></p>

