<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Our
net cash used in operating activities was INR 291.1 million in the fiscal year ended March 31, 2025, as compared to net cash used in
operating activities of INR 1,433.3 million in the fiscal year ended March 31, 2024, a decrease in cash usage of INR 1,142.3 million
in the fiscal year ended March 31, 2025. Our net loss adjusted for interest, tax, amortization and depreciation and other non-cash items
was INR 220.9 million in the fiscal year ended March 31, 2025. Further, in the fiscal year ended March 31, 2025, there was a decrease
in our working capital of INR 522.6 million, as compared to a decrease in working capital of INR 1,407.5 million in the fiscal year ended
March 31, 2024. The decrease in working capital in the fiscal year ended March 31, 2025, was primarily due to INR 693.2 million increase
in trade and other receivables, which was partially offset by INR 121.9 million increase in trade and other payables. The decrease in
working capital in the fiscal year ended March 31, 2024, was primarily due to INR 2,089.5 million increase in trade and other receivables
and INR 784.9 million increase in trade and other payables.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i>Net
cash (used in)/generated from investing activities </i></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 10pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -10pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">During the fiscal year ended March 31, 2026, cash
used in investing activities was INR 491.3 million, as compared to cash flow from investing activities, which was INR 49.0 million in
the fiscal year ended March 31, 2025. During the fiscal year ended March 31, 2026, we invested INR 85.9 million in term deposits with
banks and invested an incremental INR 448.2 million in property plant and equipment and in software and technology related development
projects. We also received interest on our term deposits of INR 42.7 million in the fiscal year ended March 31, 2026, as compared to INR
192.2 million in the fiscal year ended March 31, 2025.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 10pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -10pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
the fiscal year ended March 31, 2025, cash flow from investing activities was INR 49.0 million, as compared to cash used in
investing activities, which was INR 2,295.5 million in the fiscal year ended March 31, 2024. During the fiscal year ended March 31,
2025, we invested INR 1,289.8 million for acquisition of business, Net proceeds INR 1,432.7 million from term deposits with banks and
invested an incremental INR 286.2 million in property plant and equipment and in software and technology related development
projects. We also received interest on our term deposits of INR 192.2 million in the fiscal year ended March 31, 2025, as compared
to INR 57.0 million in the fiscal year ended March 31, 2024.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 10pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -10pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i>Net cash from/ used in financing activities.</i></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">During the fiscal year ended March 31, 2026, cash
used in financing activities was INR 63.1 million, which was primarily the result of net payment of invoice discounting/ factoring of
INR 209.9 million and repayment of loans, which was INR 13.8 million. Further, we made payments of INR 168.3 million in interest on bank
overdrafts, interest on lease liabilities, vehicle loans and payment of principal portion of lease liabilities, which was partially offset by INR 455.1 million proceeds from sale of shares by the Group.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
the fiscal year ended March 31, 2025, cash used in financing activities was INR 1,026.2 million, which was primarily the result of net
payment of INR 199.1 million against buyback of shares, net proceeds of invoice discounting/ factoring of INR 51.9 million and repayment of loans,
which was INR 743.6 million. Further, we made payments of INR 135.4 million in interest on bank overdrafts, interest on lease liabilities,
vehicle loans and payment of principal portion of lease liabilities.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 10pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -10pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Capital
Expenditures</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 10pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -10pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">We
have historically financed our capital expenditure requirements with cash flows from operations, as well as through the sale of our common
and convertible preferred shares.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">We
made capital expenditures of INR 421.7 million and INR 330.8 million in fiscal years 2026 and 2025, respectively. In addition, we expect
to spend an additional approximately INR 400 million to INR 500 million on capital expenditures during the fiscal year ending March 31,
2027. Our capital expenditures have in principle consisted of the purchases of servers, workstations, computers, computer software, leasehold
improvements and other expenditures related to our technology platform and infrastructure, the upgrading of our websites, creation of
intangible software, and mobile platforms.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: center"></p>

