<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 10pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -10pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i>Executive
Officers and Senior Management</i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 10pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -10pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Dhruv
Shringi.</b> M</span>r. Shringi is our co-founder and served as our Chief Executive Officer since June 2008 until November 2025 and
as a member of our Board since December 2005. Prior to joining our Company, Mr. Shringi was Director of Group Operations and Technology
of the Ebookers Group, London from October 2003 to June 2005. From February 2002 to September 2003, Mr. Shringi served in the Strategy
and Business Development team at Ford Motor Company in the UK, and from May 1994 to October 2000, he worked in the Audit &amp; Business
Consulting team of Arthur Anderson in their offices in India and London. He holds a B.Com (Hons.) degree from Delhi University, a Master
of Business Administration degree from INSEAD and is also a qualified chartered accountant. Mr. Shringi is currently serving as the Board
Member and Chairperson of Yatra India, and Board Members of PB Fintech Limited, Paisabazar Marketing and Consulting Private Limited,
Studio Novoforma Designs and Architecture Pvt. Ltd. and Yatra USA Corp. and does not serve on the Board of any other Public Company.
We believe Mr. Shringi is qualified to serve on our Board because of his extensive knowledge of the travel industry and his experience
as our Chief Executive Officer from June 2008 till November 2025. He is also currently serving as the co-chairman of the FICCI (Federation
of Indian Chambers of Commerce and Industry) tourism committee. He was also listed amongst the top 40 CEO&#8217;s in the country by Fortune.</p>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><b>Siddhartha Gupta </b>Mr. Gupta
is our Chief Executive Officer and a member of our Board since November 2025, where he is responsible for the Company&#8217;s strategy,
business operations, and overall management. Prior to joining Yatra, Mr. Gupta served as President of Mercer India, a business of Marsh
McLennan (NYSE: MMC), where he led the firm&#8217;s operations in India and advised leading multinational and Indian organizations on
talent, workforce, and human capital matters. Previously, Mr. Gupta served as Chief Executive Officer of Mercer Mettl, Mercer&#8217;s
talent assessment business. He joined Mettl in 2016 and played a key role in scaling the business and leading its integration with Mercer
following its acquisition. Under his leadership, Mercer Mettl expanded its market presence and became a significant growth business within
Mercer.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">Earlier in his career, Mr. Gupta
held leadership positions at SAP and HP, where he was responsible for building and growing multiple business lines. Mr. Gupta has more
than two decades of leadership experience across technology, talent management, human capital advisory, and business operations.</p>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Manish
Amin.</b> Mr. Amin is our Co-Founder and has served as our Chief Information and Technology
Officer since January 2006. He also serves as a director of, Globe All India Services Limited, TSI Yatra Private Limited, and Yatra MICE
and Holidays Limited (Formerly Yatra MICE and Holidays Private Limited) (Earlier Adventure and Nature Network Private Limited or ANN)
which are subsidiaries of Yatra India and also serves as a Director of Middle East Travel Management Company Pvt. Ltd. Prior to joining
our company, Mr. Amin worked at Ebookers, from June 1990 to November 2005 where his last role was Head of Technology Infrastructure. He
holds a general certificate in business studies from South Thames College.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Anuj
Kumar Sethi.</b> Mr. Sethi was appointed as Company&#8217;s Principal Financial Officer and Principal Accounting Officer effective from
April 11, 2025. Mr. Sethi was Sr. Director Finance at CWT India Private Limited. He had worked with CWT India Private limited from April
2000 to December 2011. He has served as Chief Financial Officer of the Company in his earlier stint as well and has also served the Company
for more than a decade in the senior finance and accounts role. He has completed his course from the Institute of Cost and Works Accountants
of India and B. Com degree from Punjab University.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 10pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -10pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i>Non-Executive
Directors</i></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 10pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -10pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Murlidhara
Lakshmikantha Kadaba.</b> M</span>r. Kadaba is the CMD of Moonbeam Capital, a Proprietary VC Firm focused on luxury, UHNI, Real Estate
and e-com Ventures. Murli has over 25 years of banking experience, with proven expertise in general management, marketing and product
development across consumer banking, wealth management, consumer lending and payment products. Before becoming an entrepreneur, he served
as the Group President and CEO of Financial Services in Reliance. Prior to this, Mr. Kadaba worked for American Express for eight years
where he was the country manager for India and area countries. He was responsible for launching Amex&#8217;s Consumer banking franchise and
several credit cards in India. Earlier, Mr. Kadaba was VP and Head of Investment Products at Citibank-India. Mr. Kadaba has served on
the boards of Amcham and Financial Planning Standards Board. He is a member of the Advisory Board of Indian Institute of Learning Management
(IILM), is an active member of YPO and was a charter member of TIE. Murli is an alumnus of XLRI, Jamshedpur and is a Graduate in Mechanical
Engineering from SJCE, Mysore. Mr. Kadaba is well qualified to serve as a director given the breadth and depth of his experience as well
as his capital markets expertise.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

