have entered into employment agreements with certain of our key employees.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Mr.
Shringi had an employment agreement with Yatra India effective January 1, 2006. The agreement contains customary provisions
regarding non-competition, non-solicitation, confidentiality of information and assignment of inventions. We and Mr. Shringi were
each obligated to provide the other party with three months&#8217; written notice to terminate the employment relationship.
