<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">On March 5, 2026, we entered
into the Consulting Agreement with Mr. Shringi, a director on the Company&#8217;s board of directors, pursuant to which Mr. Shringi will
provide certain consulting services related to business continuity and transition to the Company and its affiliates on a non-exclusive
basis as an independent contractor. The Consulting Agreement commenced retroactively effective as of March 1, 2026 (the &#8220;Effective
Date&#8221;) and shall continue until six months from the Effective Date. As compensation for the services rendered under the Consulting
Agreement, Mr. Shringi will receive a total cash compensation of $418,998 and reimbursements for actual out-of-pocket and reasonably documented
expenses, including for travel, meals and entertainment, incurred by him in connection with the performance of his duties in accordance
