  <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The financial asset is held within a business model with the
objective to hold financial assets in order to collect contractual cash flows, and</span></td></tr>

