<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><b>C. Non-controlling interests</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-04-01to2026-03-31" escape="true" id="Fact001805" name="YTRA:DisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutNoncontrollingInterestsExplanatory"><p id="xdx_89A_ecustom--DisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutNoncontrollingInterestsExplanatory_z3YQ5r8J059i" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>Details of subsidiaries that have material non-controlling interests	</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">The non-controlling interests that are material to the Group primarily
relates to Yatra India (Indian subsidiary and its step-down subsidiaries) as at and for the year ended March 31, 2026.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The table below shows summarized consolidated financial information
of Yatra India, before intercompany eliminations:</p>

