of face value of INR <span id="xdx_90F_eifrs-full--NotionalAmount_iI_pn3n3_c20240331_zfHzwzbV72ie" title="Equity shares, face value"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:NotionalAmount" contextRef="AsOf2024-03-31" id="Fact005109" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="INR">1</ix:nonFraction></span> each at an issue price of INR <span id="xdx_90D_eifrs-full--ParValuePerShare_iI_pid_c20240331_zwQPjLzn8hpf" title="Issue price per share"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:ParValuePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2024-03-31" id="Fact005111" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="INRPShares">142</ix:nonFraction></span> per share, comprising fresh issue of <span id="xdx_902_eifrs-full--NumberOfSharesIssued_iI_pid_c20240331__ifrs-full--CounterpartiesAxis__custom--YatraIndiaMember_zOuJTSyib8k4" title="Equity shares, fresh issue"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:NumberOfSharesIssued" contextRef="AsOf2024-03-31_custom_YatraIndiaMember" id="Fact005113" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">42,394,366</ix:nonFraction></span> shares and offer for sale of
